WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.168 --> 00:00:03.046
- Honestly, building a
cat fort with someone is

00:00:03.046 --> 00:00:06.507
one of the most intimate experiences that

00:00:06.507 --> 00:00:08.355
two or three humans can share together.

00:00:08.355 --> 00:00:12.367
(upbeat techno music)

00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:14.557
- Hi, my name is Jack and
we're at my apartment.

00:00:14.557 --> 00:00:16.226
What we're doin' today
is we're gonna build

00:00:16.226 --> 00:00:18.394
the world's greatest cat fort.

00:00:18.394 --> 00:00:19.937
For my cat Jenkins.

00:00:23.407 --> 00:00:26.386
This is Jenkins' current cat fort.

00:00:27.896 --> 00:00:32.825
This little tree in no way
represents what Jenkins deserves.

00:00:32.825 --> 00:00:37.727
Jenkins gives and gives and
gives, and all he does is give.

00:00:38.206 --> 00:00:40.917
I feel like a cat with a heart that big,

00:00:40.917 --> 00:00:43.314
deserves a home to match.

00:00:45.297 --> 00:00:46.465
We're all prepped, everyone is here.

00:00:46.465 --> 00:00:48.592
We've got all the stuff and
it's just the right time

00:00:48.592 --> 00:00:50.135
because every day at this time,

00:00:50.135 --> 00:00:51.836
Jenkins takes a long nap.

00:00:51.836 --> 00:00:53.722
We're gonna have to be very, very quiet

00:00:53.722 --> 00:00:54.640
so we don't wake him up.

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:55.891
But I think we're gonna get this done

00:00:55.891 --> 00:00:57.591
before cat nap time is over.

00:00:57.591 --> 00:00:59.810
I'm excited, guys let's do this!

00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:02.134
♫ Pull, rack and roll ♫

00:01:02.856 --> 00:01:03.732
- Hi, I'm Tanner.

00:01:03.732 --> 00:01:06.214
I'm helping Jack build the cat fort.

00:01:09.174 --> 00:01:10.703
- (laughs)

00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:13.617
My name is Summer and I'm
here to make sure that

00:01:13.617 --> 00:01:16.549
any cat involved in this
fort has a good time.

00:01:17.579 --> 00:01:18.612
- [Jack] Do we have enough boxes?

00:01:18.612 --> 00:01:19.412
- Yeah.

00:01:19.872 --> 00:01:21.835
You got a lot of cardboard to work with.

00:01:21.835 --> 00:01:24.503
- Jenkins has one lifelong passion,

00:01:24.503 --> 00:01:26.246
and that is a passion for cardboard.

00:01:26.246 --> 00:01:28.669
I think he's gonna be
really, really excited.

00:01:29.715 --> 00:01:30.244
(box dropping)

00:01:30.621 --> 00:01:31.774
- [Jack] Shh.

00:01:40.301 --> 00:01:42.771
You wanna have a periscope
coming out of here,

00:01:42.771 --> 00:01:44.898
so he can get in and
poke his little head out.

00:01:44.898 --> 00:01:47.147
- You wanna pull the
knife towards yourself.

00:01:47.147 --> 00:01:48.788
So, here's what I'm doing
is I'm making a shelf

00:01:48.788 --> 00:01:51.061
that's gonna sit on the inside of a box

00:01:51.061 --> 00:01:52.774
so that he can jump up

00:01:52.774 --> 00:01:54.802
and jump out the roof of the box.

00:01:54.802 --> 00:01:56.451
- I've got two triangle-shaped pieces,

00:01:56.451 --> 00:01:58.161
they've both got slits cut in them

00:01:58.161 --> 00:02:01.291
to kind of slide in there to get

00:02:01.291 --> 00:02:01.998
(box banging)

00:02:01.998 --> 00:02:03.600
right here.
(bird singing)

00:02:04.370 --> 00:02:05.971
It's a cat toy that's in there.

00:02:07.371 --> 00:02:09.797
- I am slightly worried because
we have a huge amount to do,

00:02:09.797 --> 00:02:12.421
including building a courtyard and

00:02:12.421 --> 00:02:14.016
putting crenellations and decorations

00:02:14.016 --> 00:02:15.811
on all of this stuff.

00:02:16.765 --> 00:02:19.307
Crenellation is what
you see on battlements

00:02:19.307 --> 00:02:21.908
of a castle that goes like this.

00:02:21.908 --> 00:02:24.605
So, I'm creating a little
crenellation station here,

00:02:24.605 --> 00:02:27.047
so that we can have some of this stuff

00:02:27.047 --> 00:02:29.312
all around the side of the fort.

00:02:31.528 --> 00:02:34.752
- We need one more here
to match that side.

00:02:34.752 --> 00:02:37.610
- Oh right, but you're
gonna have it go up.

00:02:37.610 --> 00:02:38.531
- No.
- [Jack] No?

00:02:38.531 --> 00:02:40.204
- [Jack] Tensions are a little bit high.

00:02:40.204 --> 00:02:41.496
My main thing is I hope that

00:02:41.496 --> 00:02:42.998
Tanner's not displeased with me.

00:02:42.998 --> 00:02:44.249
He said I was gonna be bad at this

00:02:44.249 --> 00:02:46.651
and he didn't wanna trust
me with the job, so...

00:02:46.651 --> 00:02:49.183
- Jack, how's that crenellation goin'?

00:02:49.183 --> 00:02:50.194
- Good man!

00:02:50.804 --> 00:02:51.848
Oh Jesus.

00:02:52.298 --> 00:02:54.592
Well, this is the best I can do.

00:02:54.592 --> 00:02:56.113
If he doesn't like it...

00:02:56.113 --> 00:02:59.197
(drum roll)

00:03:01.447 --> 00:03:02.281
- Good!

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:08.148
Well, I kinda lost my wind
there for a little bit,

00:03:08.148 --> 00:03:10.650
I thought we weren't gonna
get this thing done but,

00:03:10.650 --> 00:03:13.008
I think we're gonna do this.

00:03:13.008 --> 00:03:14.616
Pque-pque, pque.

00:03:15.926 --> 00:03:17.157
Okay, the cat is about to wake up.

00:03:17.157 --> 00:03:19.617
We've got five, maybe 10
more minutes if we're lucky,

00:03:19.617 --> 00:03:21.035
and we have so much more to do.

00:03:21.035 --> 00:03:22.587
I don't know if we're gonna
be able to make it in time

00:03:22.587 --> 00:03:24.083
before he gets out of bed.

00:03:24.663 --> 00:03:27.423
(energetic drum beat)

00:03:27.423 --> 00:03:28.315
- Wooo!

00:03:32.790 --> 00:03:36.968
(upbeat guitar music)

00:03:44.467 --> 00:03:46.219
- Okay, so we're finally finished.

00:03:46.219 --> 00:03:48.313
This is the completed
structure, here's what we have.

00:03:48.313 --> 00:03:51.621
We have a big skull right in the entrance,

00:03:51.621 --> 00:03:53.526
which is to intimidate Jenkins's enemies,

00:03:53.526 --> 00:03:56.307
but will not intimidate Jenkins
cuz he's a very brave boy.

00:03:56.307 --> 00:03:58.105
Everything in the courtyard here

00:03:58.105 --> 00:03:59.866
is centralized around this one pole.

00:03:59.866 --> 00:04:01.492
It's wrapped with rope so Jenkins

00:04:01.492 --> 00:04:03.536
can really scratch on it if he needs to.

00:04:03.536 --> 00:04:05.330
But it's also got a
lotta string hanging down

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:07.123
so he can play and bat at the string.

00:04:07.123 --> 00:04:10.230
He can get inside onto a big
step that's built up in there.

00:04:10.230 --> 00:04:13.355
Get onto the top where he
can look at his drawbridge.

00:04:13.355 --> 00:04:14.789
He can go inside one of these boxes

00:04:14.789 --> 00:04:16.456
and look out of his periscope.

00:04:16.456 --> 00:04:19.823
Or he can relax in this
lovely Fort Jenkins

00:04:19.823 --> 00:04:22.930
right on the far east
side of the building.

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:24.382
This is the finished cat fort.

00:04:24.382 --> 00:04:25.932
- I'm gonna get out of here.

00:04:25.932 --> 00:04:27.021
- (laughs)

00:04:27.021 --> 00:04:28.959
- It may be time to wake Jenkins up and

00:04:28.959 --> 00:04:30.765
see what he thinks of it.

00:04:30.765 --> 00:04:32.274
- Let's get Jenkins!

00:04:32.274 --> 00:04:34.140
Let's get Jenkins!

00:04:35.402 --> 00:04:36.444
- We're about to bring him in.

00:04:36.444 --> 00:04:38.363
This is gonna be his first
reaction to the fort.

00:04:38.363 --> 00:04:40.050
I don't know what to expect.

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:44.599
(suspenseful music)

00:05:00.946 --> 00:05:03.228
(laughing)

00:05:03.228 --> 00:05:07.672
(whimsical music)

